From 6792a8a3ffbe4095bccf49aa521626c7a410f489 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:02:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui): original icons for tool kinds, tree rows,
 status badges and actions

#661 slice 2: 31 new SVG masters in assets/ui/svg/, rasterised by
`cargo xtask icons` like slice 1's operation glyphs.

- Tool kinds (13, one per ToolKind - the checklist's 12 plus the plasma
  torch): mill tools hang from a solid holder block, lathe tools run
  left from a solid tool-post block. Wired in the browser's tool
  library rows, the setup's Tool list and beside the op page's picker.
- Tree rows (7): setup, part, stock, work offset, fixture, machine,
  operations folder. Setups/Machine/Operations rows and the ribbon's
  Setups door wear their own glyphs now.
- Status badges (4): solid shapes with a knocked-out mark, painted over
  an op row's glyph; they show what the row text says (BLOCKED or
  warnings -> warning, else never/ok/stale). OpStatus is unchanged.
- Actions (7): generate, post, simulate, show, hide, frame all, debug.
- 11 PNGs no longer used are deleted; 8 Tabler chrome glyphs remain.
- `cargo xtask icons --sheet` labels each icon with its stem (a 3x5
  bitmap font of our own); PROCESS_VERSION 26.

Refs #661

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
